('advanced-native-327', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-327-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It made the artwork feel more vivid and understandable to visitors."],"options":["It only supplied catalogue dates without changing the visitors’ experience of the work.","It proved every imagined detail about the painter’s day was documented.","It removed the need to view the painting itself.","It made the artwork feel more vivid and understandable to visitors."]},"advanced-native-327-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It brought the artwork to life for me.","The explanation connected the picture with a human creative process.","It helped me imagine the choices behind the colours.","It made the details feel more vivid and meaningful."],"options":["It brought the artwork to life for me.","The explanation connected the picture with a human creative process.","It helped me imagine the choices behind the colours.","It made the details feel more vivid and meaningful."]},"advanced-native-327-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The display brings the past to life while distinguishing evidence from reconstruction."],"options":["Vivid presentation means reconstruction details no longer need labels.","Visitors’ interest establishes the accuracy of every dramatic detail.","The display brings the past to life while distinguishing evidence from reconstruction."]},"advanced-native-327-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The engaging result itself confirms every historical claim."],"options":["Details help an audience imagine the setting.","A reading makes the characters feel more vivid.","The engaging result itself confirms every historical claim."]},"advanced-native-327-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We should keep the vivid presentation and clearly identify what is documented or adapted."],"options":["We should keep the vivid presentation and clearly identify what is documented or adapted.","Any detail that helps the audience imagine the period should be reported as est